DISCLAIMER FOR ANALYSIS CODE:

This code is provided for educational and analytical purposes. While efforts 
have been made to ensure accuracy and reproducibility, the authors make no 
guarantee of correctness or fitness for any particular purpose.

When analyzing real poverty data or informing policy decisions:
- Verify all results with subject matter experts
- Conduct sensitivity analysis with different assumptions
- Document all assumptions and methodological choices
- Consider ethical implications of poverty analysis

The poverty measurement methodology follows World Bank standards but may need
adaptation for specific contexts. Consult with economists and statisticians
before using results for policy decisions.

---

DATA PRIVACY:

This project template is designed to handle sensitive household survey data.
Users must ensure:
- Compliance with data protection regulations (GDPR, local laws)
- Secure storage of raw data files
- Proper anonymization before sharing results
- Clear data governance policies
- Appropriate access controls and encryption
